Package: goggle-3-liveview
Version: 0.3.3
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: knpuma <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/knpuma/goggle-3-liveview
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libicu74 | libicu76 | libicu72, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libgl1, ffmpeg (>= 6.0), python3 (>= 3.9), iproute2, pkexec, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: xwayland
Description: Direct USB viewer and MP4 recorder for DJI Goggles 3
 Independent MIT community viewer. English and Spanish interface, local MP4
 recording and clean fullscreen. No RC Pro or intermediate hardware required.
 Requires USB OTG and LiveView sharing enabled on the goggles.
